// SyntheticCalibrationSet is the small labeled set §12.2 calls for (#47).
// The labels are SYNTHETIC / INJECTED, not real production revert data —
// stated here and in BUILDATHON.md per the §12.8 honesty requirement. It
// exists so ConformalThreshold has a real input at runtime without a
